  1661	// P1T-FIX7 (V7-01 sweep (i), the guarantees a hook gives on the way out): what atexit calls, as
  1662	// atexit.register(_dlpack_exit_hook_runner, _dlpack_shutdown_hook). The hook reaches its close on every path that
