  1671	// P1T-FIX8, round-8 review finding V8-02 (MINOR), sweep (l): the allocation-free line for a record count and its first
  1672	// record (static site text, device, cudaGetErrorName's static name: CUDA 12.6 Runtime API; unverified here, lead to
