  1688	// P1T-FIX8 (V8-02): the runner's last reading, after the hook (returned or raised) and after quiescence. (1) The R7
  1689	// records nobody raised: the full message (unraisable_message), or, when it cannot allocate (FIX7 caught bad_alloc and
